## Ignore Visual Studio Code settings (optional but common)
.vscode/

## Ignore build outputs
bin/
obj/

## Ignore Rider / VS / tooling dirs
.idea/
*.user
*.suo

## Ignore publish outputs
app/
out/

## Ignore logs
*.log

## Ignore environment files
*.env
*.env.*

## Ignore temporary files
*.tmp
*.temp

## Ignore lock files
project.nuget.cache

## Ignore the http scratch file created by VS Code
*.http

## Ignore system files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

## Ignore NuGet packages (if you ever pack locally)
*.nupkg
*.snupkg

## ASP.NET data protection keys
**/App_Data/

## Optional: ignore the docker build context outputs
docker-compose.override.yml
